<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for contacting the Department of Psychology at ASU. Please visit the </span></font><a href="https://psychology.clas.asu.edu/graduate" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Psychology web site</a><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> for details about our programs. We offer six areas of study for you to choose from.  If you have specific program questions, please feel free to ask.
</span></font><br>
<br><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Have a wonderful day,</span></font><div><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Title}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Department}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#660000"><b>Arizona State University</b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Email}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="arial">{!User.Phone}</font></p></div>]]></td>
